Z||000000||rodmcneill||10-10-2001||01:14 AM||||I had bid on these rotors(84-87 fronts) on E-bay and I received them today. The cost to me including freight $52.95 for the pair! They look great not beat up or rusty. The Fiero Store sells Chinese made rotors(as most other supply houses unfortunately) for $39.99 each plus shipping. Even their frt. wheel bearings are Chinese, if I had known that I would have bought American made bearings locally. Anyhoo, Mike the guy I bought the rotors from phone# is 800-758-1928. He said he had about 8 or 9 sets of these left. I checked with him on 88 rotors,no luck at this time but he did tell me to check back as he gets closeouts all the time.||||reg||14
